{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:11b4b9560f8164cf8d157d8ca267133ba8fbdb93f1b10125650284748d96d9a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9920d3743be9664afe19a18a9c32ee1dac34a5fd5381c6b18f5dc40c83770da3",
      "text": "在理想与现实的夹缝中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97fc742662f6c8267cb1813241e554217c661db6110c3636da3b3f38e5e9a3fd",
      "text": "通过315 Pro试镜的\n辉、薰、翼3人，为了正式出道，\n开始一起进行课程训练。然而\n几人迟迟无法达成默契，终于辉与薰\n爆发了冲突。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000023:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000023:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9920d3743be9664afe19a18a9c32ee1dac34a5fd5381c6b18f5dc40c83770da3",
      "text": "在理想与现实的夹缝中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000025:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07040148948158ee20d24c7db4ef47855c677f0883c4b54eb1257d81ef39b206",
      "text": "试镜当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc9d21d6295f571284f2002c1d4a692902bfb70cd212c7eb412fbb74166ac41c",
      "text": "那么，最后请天道辉先生。\n说明一下应聘动机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e188ba292e0edfae947be2071070d2daf907218007339682921b3c6c5ec586ff",
      "text": "应聘动机吗……\n老实说，我记不太清了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02bf7f853cfda9ffe95784efc76abf229bf85979574743f87afc0f5156ebad34",
      "text": "但是，喝醉了的我说过要干吧？\n说要成为偶像，让大家都露出笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22672f7ee35bbf95a7af7c81da2c79983f7bf3ae0ba08a171a8b446ea2e69ae8",
      "text": "既然说过一次了，那就只能上了啊。\n我的信条，可是“坦率正直地活着”嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb294ba80bfd13e93f51035ec50928c1587b5042e75e78be0a7b29791eb08dc",
      "text": "到了这个年纪还当偶像，\n虽然有点不好意思……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccdd5733293a6b3ead0a6f2a9bf689781e9e8b0664dca801bbc5a2663c6c604",
      "text": "即使如此，只要合格了，\n我就会以我自己的方式努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ea9d76b7081f005f0532a3df7e5885e4edb24ea51d8d4840b8b61619d55830",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n以上，试镜正式结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f8d5a9acdf65596cc8bfa0611f33a044fb6f64be9456e7a2638fff9e71153ba",
      "text": "接下来宣布合格名单。\n被叫到名字的人，请留在原地。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c231ac3695312249e26f481785583e274dddce26636546ef504ad53fa4eb8e61",
      "text": "那么，●●●●プロデューサー。\n拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af9ff6f924a80f0a12c52323be05068a909126477ff312aff7a62c269ef43bc3",
      "text": "好的！那么，我来点名了。\n天道辉先生、柏木翼先生，以及樱庭薰先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8ca14142143ba1006ff88b66fbe4c6af25c808cd4e1ec1cab5a5b92c92193a8",
      "text": "在场的这三位，全员合格。\n今后就请多多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e129993bc68c39d4cfbf682970d56ac173914e3c3368e25574ea7fd2307b186",
      "text": "噢噢，从今天起我就是偶像了吗……\n重新整顿一下，得鼓足干劲才行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a811c2b160fc8803dc70f3a1a4ef076468992b9985edb7284aabe6d8533195",
      "text": "太好了……\n我才要请您多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
